                                "sense_id": "272bd8ae-fcf5-3ce0-83d0-2013a2964d30",
                                "text": "More specifically, many of these rocks are described as migmatites, in which the pink veins seem to blend insensibly into a kind of swirling granite."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
